              - paragraph [ref=e109]:
                - img [ref=e110]
                - text: Caution
              - paragraph [ref=e113]: Aspire testing doesn’t enable scenarios for mocking, substituting, or replacing services in dependency injection—as the tests run in a separate process.
            - generic [ref=e114]:
              - heading "When to use Aspire testing" [level=3] [ref=e115]
              - link "Section titled “When to use Aspire testing”" [ref=e116] [cursor=pointer]:
